-driven-3d-asset-generation-234d</link><description>把大模型当策划、把 3D 生成模型当建模师，用分工协作批量生产可直接进游戏的 3D 资产，附挖掘机实例拆解。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:20:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">38401f3c5590e0f41989974c9c0175cd60dd9f8b</guid><source url="https://dev.to/ameermaviaposts/a-practical-workflow-for-agent-driven-3d-asset-generation-234d">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>做一个靠谱的游戏配置推荐工具：规则、数据与诚实的建议</title><link>https://dev.to/aamitars/building-a-reliable-gaming-setup-advisor-rules-data-and-honest-recommendations-3n0k</link><description>讨论配置推荐工具该怎么设计才可信：区分硬件参数与实际游戏表现，讲清楚能验证什么、不能承诺什么，并给出 PS5 配置顾问的搭建思路。</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:30:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6dcb3101bb2c7243a324640c3bc39f00f1f81064</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aamitars/building-a-reliable-gaming-setup-advisor-rules-data-and-honest-recommendations-3n0k">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>自动化 Godot 4 GLB 资产管线：顶点轴心归位、碰撞体、遮挡器与 MeshLibrary 烘焙</title><link>https://dev.to/eachtouch/automating-godot-4-glb-asset-pipelines-vertex-pivot-grounding-colliders-occluders-meshlibrary-2obk</link><description>教你把上百个模块化 GLB 模型批量导入 Godot 4，自动归位轴心、加上碰撞体与遮挡器并烘焙成 MeshLibrary，让关卡搭建顺手得多。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:42:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b892b07803434dd0dba9c2fcd5585f32d12aa52</guid><source url="https://dev.to/eachtouch/automating-godot-4-glb-asset-pipelines-vertex-pivot-grounding-colliders-occluders-meshlibrary-2obk">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>NESkit Studio：一台能做真正 NES 游戏的幻想主机</title><link>https://dev.to/hani_craft_25ec13b5be0d40/neskit-studio-a-fantasy-console-for-nes-3e81</link><description>用 C99 与 cc65 打造的幻想主机，内置精灵、地图、音效、音乐追踪器与代码编辑器，让 NES 游戏开发变得更顺手。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:14:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a2f51eb59dd4b29bd3e08b88a814e758df4bed6d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/hani_craft_25ec13b5be0d40/neskit-studio-a-fantasy-console-for-nes-3e81">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>GTA